{"tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h1_text.wedding_vendor_tip_calculator.526f2b77":"Wedding Vendor Tip Calculator","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.nobody_invoices_you_for_tips_they_are_ca.6e398065":"Nobody invoices you for tips. They are cash, due on the day, and the last thing anyone budgets — this turns your contracts into a labelled envelope list.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.home.8cf04a97":"Home","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.free_tools.c746326b":"Free Tools","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.your_contracts.59a1e81a":"Your contracts","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.label_text.food_beverage_bill.a67f8098":"Food &amp; beverage bill","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.label_text.catering_tip_rate.6bf9c168":"Catering tip rate (%)","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.span_text.contract_already_distributes_its_service.0e955eb6":"Contract already distributes its service charge to staff","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.label_text.bar_bill.8671a8bc":"Bar bill","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.label_text.hair_makeup_bill.88f38a9d":"Hair &amp; makeup bill","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.label_text.dj_band_flat_tip.5989e89b":"DJ / band flat tip","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.label_text.photographer_videographer_flat_tip.bb26a348":"Photographer / videographer flat tip","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.label_text.officiant_honorarium.11b0d6d3":"Officiant honorarium","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.a_service_charge_often_18_24_is_not_auto.b22a0ad2":"A service charge (often 18–24%) is not automatically a gratuity. Ask the manager whether it reaches the staff before tipping twice.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.cash_to_set_aside.bd383531":"Cash to set aside","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.0_of_0_done.c7d9bf0c":"0 of 0 done","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.button_text.copy_result.76cfa6f1":"Copy result","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.button_text.download_txt.5f29b5ba":"Download .txt","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.button_text.print_pdf.963ace37":"Print / PDF","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.button_text.another_version.647b4bc0":"Another version","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.button_text.reset.526d688f":"Reset","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.the_trap_that_costs_couples_hundreds.23b68429":"The trap that costs couples hundreds","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.span_text.every_ranked_2026_tipping_guide_leads_wi.57ac3de0":"Every ranked 2026 tipping guide leads with the same warning:","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.strong_text.a_service_charge_on_a_catering_or_venue.1cf62ea7":"a \"service charge\" on a catering or venue contract (often 18–24%) is not necessarily a tip","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.span_text.it_may_be_a_house_fee_that_never_reaches.dd95e85a":". It may be a house fee that never reaches the staff. Ask the manager directly whether it is distributed as gratuity. If it is, you are covered; if it is not, tip the servers and bartenders directly. Never pay a separate gratuity line twice.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.th_text.vendor.ec9ceefe":"Vendor","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.th_text.customary_us_tip.5ae822e9":"Customary US tip","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.th_text.note.3b0649c7":"Note","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.caterer_wait_staff.d9171a64":"Caterer &amp; wait staff","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.15_20_of_food_beverage.d001cae8":"15–20% of food &amp; beverage","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.only_if_no_distributed_service_charge.9d189b54":"Only if no distributed service charge","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.bartenders.5008fbbb":"Bartenders","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.10_of_the_bar_bill_or_20_50_each.df2d3cdd":"10% of the bar bill, or $20–$50 each","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.often_built_into_the_bar_package.0964c35e":"Often built into the bar package","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.hair_makeup.e9e357a1":"Hair &amp; makeup","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.15_20_of_the_service_bill.0ef915e1":"15–20% of the service bill","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.tip_like_a_salon_visit.d78829af":"Tip like a salon visit","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.dj.27a5773a":"DJ","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.10_15_or_50_150_flat.aebf1ccd":"10–15% or $50–$150 flat","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.hand_over_at_the_last_song.f12cd6e3":"Hand over at the last song","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.band.67fd95fc":"Band","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.25_50_per_musician.935ce2d0":"$25–$50 per musician","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.or_one_envelope_to_the_bandleader.2513be9a":"Or one envelope to the bandleader","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.photographer_videographer.6c281c57":"Photographer / videographer","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.50_200_flat_optional.1f38cde7":"$50–$200 flat, optional","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.often_the_business_owner_a_review_matter.9e4f3609":"Often the business owner — a review matters more","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.officiant.62120c94":"Officiant","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.50_100.fc9495c7":"$50–$100","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.or_a_donation_to_their_house_of_worship.2c9641a7":"Or a donation to their house of worship","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.planner_coordinator.4e3b264b":"Planner / coordinator","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.50_200_optional.7a97232c":"$50–$200, optional","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.not_expected_if_they_own_the_business.b99bec1e":"Not expected if they own the business","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.transport_delivery_crew.5f5aae90":"Transport / delivery crew","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.15_20_of_fare_5_20_each.6894c220":"15–20% of fare / $5–$20 each","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.td_text.check_whether_gratuity_was_pre_added.7a23451d":"Check whether gratuity was pre-added","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.what_couples_actually_did_in_2026.4d90e4f1":"What couples actually did in 2026","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.span_text.zola_s_2026_wedding_spend_survey_asked_7.c62c031c":"Zola's 2026 Wedding Spend Survey asked 720 couples within six months of their weddings who they tipped:","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.strong_text.caterers_73_hair_and_makeup_71_photograp.43a6123d":"caterers 73%, hair and makeup 71%, photographers 70%, DJ or band 67%, and planners 48%","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.span_text.zola_suggests_budgeting_roughly_5_10_of.d914e943":". Zola suggests budgeting roughly 5–10% of the total wedding cost for tips. Most couples hand out cash on the day, so the practical job is working out the total before the venue day — not after.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.how_to_hand_it_over.c791c649":"How to hand it over","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.a_week_before_the_wedding_withdraw_the_c.ddc78245":"A week before the wedding, withdraw the cash and put each amount in a labelled envelope with the vendor's name. Ask a trusted person — best man, maid of honour or coordinator — to distribute them as each vendor wraps up. A short thank-you note inside each envelope goes a long way. Use Print / PDF for the envelope list. If a vendor owns the business, a tip is appreciated but not expected; a five-star review and referrals are worth more. This is customary US guidance — tipping expectations differ across Europe, so check local norms for a destination wedding.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.span_text.want_to_see_the_whole_picture_put_these.08c0c3cb":"Want to see the whole picture? Put these figures next to the","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.budget_calculator.060f44a9":"budget calculator","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.span_text.and_the.24576d62":"and the","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.planning_checklist.2c358079":"planning checklist","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.frequently_asked_questions.af2a4d28":"Frequently asked questions","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.summary_text.do_i_tip_if_there_is_already_a_service_c.86b2a66e":"Do I tip if there is already a service charge?","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.not_necessarily_a_service_charge_of_18_2.1613236f":"Not necessarily. A service charge of 18–24% is often a house fee, not a gratuity. Ask the catering or venue manager whether it is distributed to staff. If it is, you are covered; if it is not, tip the staff directly — but never pay a separate gratuity line twice.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.summary_text.how_much_should_i_tip_a_wedding_photogra.bff14b4e":"How much should I tip a wedding photographer?","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.a_flat_50_200_is_customary_and_it_is_opt.da1651c9":"A flat $50–$200 is customary, and it is optional — many photographers own the business and set their own price. Tip second shooters and assistants too; a five-star review and referrals are often worth more than cash.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.summary_text.do_you_tip_the_wedding_dj.e786a08c":"Do you tip the wedding DJ?","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.yes_10_15_of_the_fee_or_a_flat_50_150_fo.87a85af0":"Yes, 10–15% of the fee or a flat $50–$150 for a solo DJ. For a band, $25–$50 per musician, or one envelope to the bandleader who splits it. Hand it over at the end of the reception.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.summary_text.how_much_do_most_couples_spend_on_weddin.d6eb1e55":"How much do most couples spend on wedding tips in total?","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.ranked_guides_put_a_mid_size_us_wedding.4d79119d":"Ranked guides put a mid-size US wedding between roughly $500 and $1,000+, with some 2026 budget models reaching $1,500–$4,000 for a 100-guest wedding with a full vendor list. Zola suggests budgeting 5–10% of the total wedding cost.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.summary_text.should_i_tip_a_vendor_who_owns_the_busin.a3cef2ab":"Should I tip a vendor who owns the business?","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.a_tip_is_appreciated_but_not_expected_th.599504d2":"A tip is appreciated but not expected — they set their own price. Focus cash tips on staff and employees. A heartfelt review, referrals, or a thank-you note are excellent alternatives.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.summary_text.when_and_how_are_tips_handed_out.a77df3b8":"When and how are tips handed out?","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.in_cash_on_the_wedding_day_prepare_label.f3bd5f22":"In cash, on the wedding day. Prepare labelled envelopes a week ahead and ask a trusted person — a coordinator, best man or maid of honour — to distribute them as vendors finish. Print the envelope list from this page so nothing is forgotten.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.more_free_wedding_tools.511ec8cc":"More free wedding tools","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.budget_calculator.4a2217e0":"Budget Calculator","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.seating_chart.0aa1b5db":"Seating Chart","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.hashtag_generator.f0d774ee":"Hashtag Generator","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.invitation_maker.eaa060de":"Invitation Maker","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.save_the_date.f3ad2c82":"Save the Date","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.photo_book_planner.a9887dd0":"Photo Book Planner","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.photo_collage.942e207a":"Photo Collage","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.heic_to_jpg.67ca8d18":"HEIC to JPG","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.planning_checklist.8d9c7c04":"Planning Checklist","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.alcohol_calculator.aa6ed7fc":"Alcohol Calculator","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.vow_writer.90e3a3d2":"Vow Writer","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.speech_writer.7bd24d35":"Speech Writer","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.guest_count_calculator.3713f2ea":"Guest Count Calculator","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.h2_text.planning_done_let_s_make_the_film.acbc362d":"Planning done? Let's make the film.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.p_text.turn_the_photos_and_words_from_your_plan.8830dc77":"Turn the photos and words from your planning into a 60–90 second cinematic wedding film.","tools.wedding-vendor-tipping-calculator.a_text.get_a_free_quote.076af0bf":"Get a Free Quote &rarr;"}